{"seq":2,"slug":"exposure-contrast","title":"曝光与对比度修正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/exposure-contrast","wordCount":1833,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"曝光与对比度修正\">曝光与对比度修正</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>曝光与对比度修正决定画面的亮度分布，其核心要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>曝光的双重性</strong>：既要把整体亮度落到技术规范范围内，又要为后续创意调色保留最大动态范围。</li>\n<li><strong>度量体系</strong>：IRE、Stops、Nits、Code Value、Linear 从不同角度描述同一亮度，SDR 合法范围通常为 0–100 IRE。</li>\n<li><strong>Lift/Gamma/Gain 模型</strong>：用三段控制替代简单亮度滑块，分别独立作用于暗部、中间调与高光，避免联动副作用。</li>\n<li><strong>波形图判读</strong>：顶部截断=过曝、底部截断=黑死、范围窄=低对比，是曝光修正的主要参考。</li>\n<li><strong>对比度即 S 曲线</strong>：通过压缩高光与暗部、扩展中间调斜率来制造反差，Pivot 决定旋转中心。</li>\n<li><strong>恢复有边界</strong>：高光与暗部的可恢复档数受编码位深与降噪能力约束，提升 1 档曝光噪点约加倍。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"曝光修正的技术基础\">曝光修正的技术基础</h2><p>曝光修正是一次校正中与白平衡并列的核心操作，目标是将画面的整体亮度分布调整到技术规范允许的范围内，同时保留最大的动态范围信息。正确的曝光是后续所有调色操作的前提——过曝或欠曝的素材在创意调色阶段会暴露出噪点增加、色彩偏移或细节丢失等不可逆问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;曝光评估与修正流程&quot;&#10;        INPUT[原始素材] --&gt; SCOPE[示波器分析]&#10;        SCOPE --&gt; JUDGE{曝光判断}&#10;        JUDGE --&gt;|欠曝| LIFT[提升 Gain/Gamma]&#10;        JUDGE --&gt;|过曝| LOWER[降低 Gain]&#10;        JUDGE --&gt;|正常| PASS[进入对比度调整]&#10;        LIFT --&gt; NOISE[评估噪点增加]&#10;        LOWER --&gt; CLIP[评估高光恢复]&#10;        NOISE --&gt; PASS&#10;        CLIP --&gt; PASS&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"曝光评估与修正流程\"\n        INPUT[原始素材] --&gt; SCOPE[示波器分析]\n        SCOPE --&gt; JUDGE{曝光判断}\n        JUDGE --&gt;|欠曝| LIFT[提升 Gain/Gamma]\n        JUDGE --&gt;|过曝| LOWER[降低 Gain]\n        JUDGE --&gt;|正常| PASS[进入对比度调整]\n        LIFT --&gt; NOISE[评估噪点增加]\n        LOWER --&gt; CLIP[评估高光恢复]\n        NOISE --&gt; PASS\n        CLIP --&gt; PASS\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"曝光度量标准\">曝光度量标准</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n<th>单位/范围</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IRE</td>\n<td>0-100 (SDR)</td>\n<td>广播标准电平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stops</td>\n<td>±N EV</td>\n<td>相对曝光偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nits</td>\n<td>0.001-10000 cd/m²</td>\n<td>HDR 绝对亮度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Code Value</td>\n<td>0-1023 (10bit)</td>\n<td>数字信号电平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linear</td>\n<td>0.0-∞</td>\n<td>物理光照度比例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SDR 规范中，合法信号范围为 0-100 IRE：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SDR 合法范围</mtext><mo>:</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>黑电平（Black Level）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>白电平（White Level）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>超白（Super White）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>109</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>I</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>有争议</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SDR 合法范围}: \\begin{cases}\n\\text{黑电平（Black Level）} = 0\\ IRE \\\\\n\\text{白电平（White Level）} = 100\\ IRE \\\\\n\\text{超白（Super White）} = 100\\text{-}109\\ IRE\\ (\\text{有争议})\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SDR </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合法范围</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">黑电平（</span><span class=\"mord\">Black Level</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">白电平（</span><span class=\"mord\">White Level</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">超白（</span><span class=\"mord\">Super White</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">109</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有争议</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"lift-gamma-gain-模型\">Lift / Gamma / Gain 模型</h3><p>专业调色软件使用 Lift-Gamma-Gain 三段控制替代简单的亮度/对比度滑块：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制</th>\n<th>作用区域</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Lift</td>\n<td>暗部（阴影）</td>\n<td>提升/降低黑电平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gamma</td>\n<td>中间调</td>\n<td>调整中灰亮度（非线性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gain</td>\n<td>亮部（高光）</td>\n<td>调整白电平峰值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Offset</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>整体亮度偏移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Output</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Gain</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Input</mtext><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>Gamma</mtext></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>Lift</mtext><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Input</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>Offset</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Output} = \\text{Gain} \\times (\\text{Input})^{\\frac{1}{\\text{Gamma}}} + \\text{Lift} \\times (1 - \\text{Input}) + \\text{Offset}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Output</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gain</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.254em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.004em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.413em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8443em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.656em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Gamma</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line mtight\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.049em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.384em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.344em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lift</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Offset</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一模型允许调色师独立控制画面不同亮度区域，避免全局调整带来的联动副作用。例如，提升 Lift 可以&quot;提亮阴影&quot;而不影响高光——这是简单 Brightness 控制无法做到的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"示波器指导曝光\">示波器指导曝光</h2><h3 id=\"waveform-波形图\">Waveform 波形图</h3><p>Waveform 是曝光修正的主要参考工具，横轴对应画面水平位置，纵轴表示亮度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波形特征</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>处理建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顶部截断（flatline at 100）</td>\n<td>高光过曝/削波</td>\n<td>降低 Gain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底部截断（flatline at 0）</td>\n<td>暗部完全黑死</td>\n<td>提升 Lift（如非刻意）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整体偏高</td>\n<td>过曝</td>\n<td>降低 Offset 或 Gain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整体偏低</td>\n<td>欠曝</td>\n<td>提升 Offset 或 Gamma</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围窄（中段集中）</td>\n<td>低对比度/灰雾</td>\n<td>拉开 Lift-Gain 范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Waveform 典型问题&quot;&#10;        direction TB&#10;        W1[&quot;过曝: 波形撞顶&quot;]&#10;        W2[&quot;欠曝: 波形集中底部&quot;]&#10;        W3[&quot;低对比: 波形窄带&quot;]&#10;        W4[&quot;正常: 0-100 全分布&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Waveform 典型问题\"\n        direction TB\n        W1[\"过曝: 波形撞顶\"]\n        W2[\"欠曝: 波形集中底部\"]\n        W3[\"低对比: 波形窄带\"]\n        W4[\"正常: 0-100 全分布\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"histogram-直方图\">Histogram 直方图</h3><p>直方图显示画面中各亮度值的像素数量分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>count</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>pixels where luminance</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1023</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(v) = \\text{count}(\\text{pixels where luminance} = v),\\quad v \\in [0, 1023]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">count</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pixels where luminance</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1023</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理想曝光的直方图应覆盖全部有效范围，不在两端堆积（表示过曝或欠曝），且分布形态与场景内容一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对比度调整策略\">对比度调整策略</h2><h3 id=\"s-曲线与对比度\">S 曲线与对比度</h3><p>对比度本质上是亮部与暗部之间的亮度差值。最基本的对比度控制是 S 曲线——在传输曲线上制造高光压缩和暗部压缩，同时扩展中间调的斜率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线类型</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S 曲线（温和）</td>\n<td>自然对比度增强</td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S 曲线（陡峭）</td>\n<td>高对比度/戏剧化</td>\n<td>电影质感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反 S 曲线</td>\n<td>降低对比度/雾感</td>\n<td>梦境/回忆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>无改变</td>\n<td>RAW 直出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对数</td>\n<td>保留动态范围</td>\n<td>Log 编码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>S 曲线公式</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{S 曲线公式}(x) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-k(x - 0.5)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">曲线公式</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 控制曲线的陡峭程度——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大对比度越强。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pivot-与-contrast-的关系\">Pivot 与 Contrast 的关系</h3><p>DaVinci Resolve 中 Contrast 滑块配合 Pivot 参数工作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Contrast</strong>：控制曲线中心点两侧的扩展程度</li>\n<li><strong>Pivot</strong>：定义对比度的旋转中心点（默认 0.435）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Contrast 效果</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Output</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Input</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>Pivot</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>Contrast</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Pivot</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Contrast 效果}: \\text{Output} = (\\text{Input} - \\text{Pivot}) \\times \\text{Contrast} + \\text{Pivot}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Contrast </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">效果</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Output</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Input</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pivot</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Contrast</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pivot</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Pivot 低于默认值时，对比度增强偏向暗部（暗部更暗）；Pivot 高于默认值时偏向亮部（亮部更亮）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态范围恢复\">动态范围恢复</h2><h3 id=\"log-素材的动态范围优势\">Log 素材的动态范围优势</h3><p>Log 编码的核心价值是在有限位深中保留最大动态范围：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码格式</th>\n<th>动态范围</th>\n<th>中灰位置</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rec.709 (SDR)</td>\n<td>~6 档</td>\n<td>46% IRE</td>\n<td>普通视频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-Log3</td>\n<td>~14 档</td>\n<td>41% IRE</td>\n<td>Sony 摄影机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C-Log3</td>\n<td>~14.5 档</td>\n<td>32% IRE</td>\n<td>Canon Cinema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V-Log</td>\n<td>~14 档</td>\n<td>42% IRE</td>\n<td>Panasonic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Log-C4</td>\n<td>~17 档</td>\n<td>33% IRE</td>\n<td>ARRI ALEXA 35</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BRAW</td>\n<td>~13 档</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>Blackmagic</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>曝光修正时，Log 素材允许约 ±2-3 档的曝光恢复而不引入明显噪点或色彩偏移。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高光恢复技术\">高光恢复技术</h3><p>过曝高光的恢复能力取决于原始数据中是否保留了有效信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过曝程度</th>\n<th>RAW 恢复潜力</th>\n<th>Log 恢复潜力</th>\n<th>Rec.709 恢复</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>+0.5 EV</td>\n<td>完全恢复</td>\n<td>完全恢复</td>\n<td>部分恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+1.0 EV</td>\n<td>完全恢复</td>\n<td>大部分恢复</td>\n<td>困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+2.0 EV</td>\n<td>大部分恢复</td>\n<td>部分恢复</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>+3.0 EV</td>\n<td>部分恢复</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n<td>不可能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可恢复档数</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>编码位深剩余 headroom</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>总动态范围</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>标称曝光占用档数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可恢复档数} \\approx \\text{编码位深剩余 headroom} = \\text{总动态范围} - \\text{标称曝光占用档数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可恢复档数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">编码位深剩余</span><span class=\"mord\"> headroom</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总动态范围</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">标称曝光占用档数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"暗部提升与噪点管理\">暗部提升与噪点管理</h3><p>提升欠曝暗部时，噪点会同比例放大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>噪点增加量</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mtext>原始噪点水平</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{噪点增加量} \\approx 2^{|\\Delta EV|} \\times \\text{原始噪点水平}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">噪点增加量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原始噪点水平</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每提升 1 档曝光，噪点电平加倍。实际操作建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>欠曝 ≤1 档：可安全提升</li>\n<li>欠曝 1-2 档：需配合降噪</li>\n<li>欠曝 &gt;2 档：严重噪点，需空间降噪+时间降噪</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"广播安全与交付规范\">广播安全与交付规范</h2><h3 id=\"sdr-交付标准\">SDR 交付标准</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准</th>\n<th>黑电平</th>\n<th>白电平</th>\n<th>峰值允许</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EBU R.103</td>\n<td>0 IRE</td>\n<td>100 IRE</td>\n<td>104 IRE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ATSC/SMPTE</td>\n<td>7.5 IRE (setup)</td>\n<td>100 IRE</td>\n<td>110 IRE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web/社交</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>Full Range</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Netflix SDR</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>100 IRE</td>\n<td>100 IRE strict</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DaVinci Resolve 的 Broadcast Safe 滤波器可自动将信号限制在规范范围内：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    GRADE[调色输出] --&gt; BS[Broadcast Safe 节点]&#10;    BS --&gt; CLIP_H[高光软裁切 at 100 IRE]&#10;    BS --&gt; CLIP_L[暗部软裁切 at 0 IRE]&#10;    CLIP_H --&gt; OUTPUT[合规输出]&#10;    CLIP_L --&gt; OUTPUT\">graph LR\n    GRADE[调色输出] --&gt; BS[Broadcast Safe 节点]\n    BS --&gt; CLIP_H[高光软裁切 at 100 IRE]\n    BS --&gt; CLIP_L[暗部软裁切 at 0 IRE]\n    CLIP_H --&gt; OUTPUT[合规输出]\n    CLIP_L --&gt; OUTPUT</pre><p>软裁切（Soft Clip）比硬裁切（Hard Clip）更自然——它在接近限制值时逐渐压缩信号斜率，而非突然截断，避免产生色彩断层。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>曝光修正是与白平衡并列的一次校正核心操作，目标是在技术规范内重建正确的亮度分布。它以 IRE/Stops/Nits 等度量体系为判断基准，用 Lift-Gamma-Gain 三段模型替代简单亮度滑块，从而独立控制暗部、中间调与高光。Waveform 与 Histogram 是曝光判断的主要工具，对比度则通过 S 曲线与 Pivot 参数塑造。动态范围恢复能力受编码位深约束——Log 素材可容忍约 ±2–3 档曝光恢复，而暗部提升会按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{|\\Delta EV|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 放大噪点。最终输出还需遵循 EBU、ATSC、Netflix 等广播安全规范，软裁切比硬裁切更能避免色彩断层。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"曝光与对比度修正","id":"曝光与对比度修正"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"曝光修正的技术基础","id":"曝光修正的技术基础"},{"level":3,"text":"曝光度量标准","id":"曝光度量标准"},{"level":3,"text":"Lift / Gamma / Gain 模型","id":"lift-gamma-gain-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"示波器指导曝光","id":"示波器指导曝光"},{"level":3,"text":"Waveform 波形图","id":"waveform-波形图"},{"level":3,"text":"Histogram 直方图","id":"histogram-直方图"},{"level":2,"text":"对比度调整策略","id":"对比度调整策略"},{"level":3,"text":"S 曲线与对比度","id":"s-曲线与对比度"},{"level":3,"text":"Pivot 与 Contrast 的关系","id":"pivot-与-contrast-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"动态范围恢复","id":"动态范围恢复"},{"level":3,"text":"Log 素材的动态范围优势","id":"log-素材的动态范围优势"},{"level":3,"text":"高光恢复技术","id":"高光恢复技术"},{"level":3,"text":"暗部提升与噪点管理","id":"暗部提升与噪点管理"},{"level":2,"text":"广播安全与交付规范","id":"广播安全与交付规范"},{"level":3,"text":"SDR 交付标准","id":"sdr-交付标准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"白平衡校正与色温还原","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/white-balance-correction"},"next":{"title":"色彩平衡还原与肤色保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-grading-craft/color-correction/color-balance"}}